  "_title": "Four-Bolt Annular Proof-Pressure Cover",
  "_purpose": "CAE companion of FEA Plate Solution Space.json; expose H, big_R and bolt_d.",
  "_fidelity": "Linear elastic Tet10 CalculiX study; mm, N, MPa, s, tonne. OD160mm, PCD120mm; all four bore faces fixed; 1.5MPa inward pressure on bottom annular face.",
  "_baseline": "H=12mm, big_R=25mm, bolt_d=10.5mm. Recompute response values; no mesh-converged reference is claimed.",
  "_engineering_limits": [
    "No bolts, preload, gasket, contact, fatigue or buckling model.",
    "Bore constraints can create stress singularities. Compare refined meshes and structural stress away from ideal supports."
  ],
  "_workflow": [
    "Preview the cover and check four selected bore faces.",
    "Run Static Solver with CalculiX installed.",
    "Refine element_size and compare stress, displacement and reactions.",
    "Use the exposed H, big_R and bolt_d in the matching MDAO model."
  ],
  "_acceptance_criteria": [
